{"speciesId":348,"names":{"fr":"Armaldo","es":"Armaldo","en":"Armaldo","ja":"アーマルド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ARMALDO’s tough armor makes all attacks bounce off. This POKéMON’s two enormous claws can be freely extended or contracted. They have the power to punch right through a steel slab."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ARMALDO is a POKéMON species that became extinct in prehistoric times. This POKéMON is said to have walked on its hind legs, which would have been more convenient for life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"ARMALDO usually lives on land. However, when it hunts for prey, it dives beneath the ocean. It swims around using its two large wings."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Protected by a hard shell, its body is very sturdy. It skewers prey with its claws to feed."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Protected by a hard shell, its body is very sturdy. It skewers prey with its claws to feed."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its enormous, retractable claws can cut through most anything. Its entire body is clad in sturdy plates."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its enormous, retractable claws can cut through most anything. Its entire body is clad in sturdy plates."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a gagné la côte après son évolution. Une armure robuste recouvre son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a gagné la côte après son évolution. Une armure robuste recouvre son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon au corps blindé peut allonger ou rétracter ses énormes pinces pour embrocher ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Ensarta a sus presas con sus gigantescas garras elásticas. Una fuerte coraza cubre su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its enormous, retractable claws can cut through most anything. Its entire body is clad in sturdy plates."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"伸び縮みする 巨大な ツメで 獲物を くし刺しにして 捕らえる。 丈夫な よろいを 身に まとう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Rien ne peut transpercer la cuirasse d’Armaldo. Ce Pokémon embroche ses proies avec ses griffes pour les avaler plus facilement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Está protegido por una fuerte armadura y tiene un cuerpo robusto. Engancha a sus presas con las pinzas y las devora."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Protected by a hard shell, its body is very sturdy. It skewers prey with its claws to feed."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"甲羅に 覆われた 体は とても 頑丈。鋭い ツメで 獲物を くしざしにして 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le puissant blindage d’Armaldo peut repousser toute attaque. Les énormes pinces de ce Pokémon peuvent s’allonger ou se rétracter. Elles peuvent transpercer une plaque d’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Armaldo tiene una sólida armadura que repele cualquier ataque. Este Pokémon puede estirar o encoger todo lo que quiera las pinzas que tiene. Con ellas, puede atravesar una plancha de acero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Armaldo’s tough armor makes all attacks bounce off. This Pokémon’s two enormous claws can be freely extended or contracted. They have the power to punch right through a steel slab."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甲羅は あらゆる 攻撃を はね返す。 伸び 縮みする 巨大な ２本の ツメは 鉄板を くし刺しにする ほどの 威力だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Armaldo fait partie d’une espèce de Pokémon qui s’est éteinte à l’époque préhistorique. On raconte que ce Pokémon marchait sur ses pattes arrière, ce qui facilitait sa vie sur la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Armaldo es una de las especies de Pokémon que se extinguieron en la era prehistórica. Se cree que caminaban sobre las patas traseras; lo más apropiado para la vida en tierra firme."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Armaldo is a Pokémon species that became extinct in prehistoric times. This Pokémon is said to have walked on its hind legs, which would have been more convenient for life on land."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大昔 絶滅した ポケモンの 一種。 地上で 暮らすとき 便利な ように ２本の 足で 歩くように なったと いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon terrestre avait pour habitude d’aller chasser ses proies en mer à l’aide de ses armes de prédilection : ses griffes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Vivía en tierra firme, pero se adentraba en el mar en busca de presas a las que cazar con sus afiladas pinzas, un arma de lo más temible."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It lived on land and went out into the sea to hunt for prey. Its sharp claws were its greatest weapon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"陸に 暮らし 獲物を 求めて 海へ 狩りへと でかけていた。 鋭い ツメが 最大の 武器。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Considéré comme l’un des ancêtres des Pokémon Insecte, il avait quitté la mer pour s’installer sur la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon abandonó el mar para habitar en tierra firme. Según se ha demostrado, es el antepasado de algunos Pokémon insecto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Armaldo adapted from living in water to living on land. It has been determined that it is the ancestor of some bug Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"海から 地上で 暮らすように なった。 一部の むしポケモンの 祖先で あることが わかった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Depuis son évolution, il vit sur la terre ferme. Ses membres inférieurs se sont développés et ses coups de queue sont dévastateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Tras evolucionar, pasó a vivir en tierra firme. Posee tal fuerza en la parte inferior del cuerpo que un solo coletazo puede resultar devastador."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"After evolution, this Pokémon emerged onto land. Its lower body has become stronger, and blows from its tail are devastating."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"進化して 陸地に 上がった。 下半身が 強化され しっぽの 一撃は すごい 破壊力だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien que vivant sur la terre ferme, il est très bon nageur. Il plonge dans la mer à la recherche de proies et les abat avec ses pinces acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en tierra firme, pero es un hábil nadador. Se zambulle en el agua en busca de presas y las atrapa con sus afiladas pinzas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Though it lives on land, it’s also a good swimmer. It dives into the ocean in search of prey, using its sharp claws to take down its quarry."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"陸地で 生活するが 泳ぎも 得意。 獲物を 求めて 海に 潜り 鋭い ツメで しとめる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":348,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[